  "details": "# Issue:\n\nAttempting to edit an emoji and then canceling out of the edit results in the user being unable to edit the emoji anymore. This persists until the user restarts VRChat.\n\n# Reproduction Steps:\n\n1. Select A custom emoji and hit the Edit button\n\n2. Cancel out of the Edit process at any point\n\n3. Attempt to hit the Edit button again. It should no longer work.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nIdea is that we should be able to edit the emoji after canceling. Canceling and re-pressing the edit button works properly for Stickers. Just seems to break for Emojis.\n\n# Attachments Description:\n\nAttached is a video showcasing the bug. Includes re-joining the instance to show that the bug persists between instances.",
